      }
    },
    "查看所有颜色的库存状态\n点击颜色卡片可编辑库存\n支持按品牌色号显示\n可搜索任意品牌的色号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View stock status for all colors\nTap color cards to edit stock\nDisplay by brand color codes\nSearch any brand's color codes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍照或选择色号表格图片\n自动识别色号和数量\n可手动编辑识别结果\n确认后自动从库存扣减": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a photo or select a color chart image\nAutomatically recognize codes and quantities\nManually edit recognition results\nConfirm to automatically deduct from stock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "输入任意品牌色号查询\n自动显示对应的其他品牌色号\n支持 MARD、vivid、漫漫、卡卡\n点击可复制色号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter any brand code to search\nAutomatically show corresponding codes from other brands\nSupports MARD, vivid, Manman, KaKa\nTap to copy code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看整体库存使用情况\n使用量排行榜\n低库存预警\n项目历史记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View overall inventory usage\nUsage rankings\nLow stock warnings\nProject history"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "建议初始库存设为1000颗/色\n识别有水印图片时，可手动调整结果\n定期导出数据做备份\n低库存颜色会红色标识": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended initial stock: 1000 pcs/color\nFor watermarked images, manually adjust results\nRegularly export data for backup\nLow stock colors are highlighted in red"
          }
        }
      }
    },
